        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transport, natural gas, pipeline, long distance</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transport, natural gas, pipeline, long distance
na;
UUID: 134ac708-5e0e-3972-8428-435263764f90
This dataset describes the energy consumption and the emissions linked to the transport of 1 tkm Russian natural gas in an onshore pipeline.; Geography: The data for emissions and for energy requirements is based on German data.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Long-distance gas transport onshore with average compressor station.
Time period: The data for emissions is from 1994, the data for energy requirements from 2001.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_134ac708-5e0e-3972-8428-435263764f90.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
